const __vite_ssr_export_default__ = /* #__PURE__ */ JSON.parse("[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-01\",\n    \"topic\": \"An Environmental Problem in Your Area\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an environmental problem in your city or hometown.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the problem is and where it occurs\",\n        \"What causes this problem\",\n        \"What negative impacts it has on daily life\",\n        \"And explain what measures could be taken to resolve it\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"I would like to talk about the acute air pollution and particulate smog that plagues my metropolitan hometown, particularly during the dry winter months. This issue is predominantly localized around major arterial ring roads and industrial development zones on the city's perimeter.\\n\\nThe principal culprit is the sheer volume of vehicular exhaust emissions generated by private diesel automobiles and heavy freight trucks, exacerbated by localized coal combustion and rapid construction dust. Due to our city's basin topography, stagnant atmospheric conditions frequently trap these toxic airborne particulates close to ground level for consecutive weeks.\\n\\nThe repercussions on daily urban life are severe. On hazardous smog days, visibility plunges dramatically, disrupting morning transport and increasing traffic collisions. More alarmingly, respiratory ailments, bronchial infections, and pediatric asthma flare-ups escalate, putting immense strain on municipal health clinics. Vulnerable elderly citizens are frequently forced to remain sequestered indoors.\\n\\nTo tackle this crisis sustainably, the local municipal council must aggressively subsidize the electrification of public bus fleets and mandate stringent emission inspections for commercial haulage vehicles. Furthermore, expanding urban green belts and constructing dedicated cycling corridors would incentivize commuters away from personal cars. Ultimately, transitioning to cleaner renewable energy and enforcing stricter industrial emission caps are paramount to restoring breathable air.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"acute air pollution\",\n      \"vehicular exhaust emissions\",\n      \"basin topography\",\n      \"respiratory ailments\",\n      \"stringent emission inspections\",\n      \"transitioning to cleaner renewable energy\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-01-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Do you believe individual actions or government regulations are more critical in solving environmental crises?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Argue that while grassroots lifestyle modifications raise collective awareness, only centralized government mandates and corporate penalties possess the systemic scale needed to effect substantial carbon reductions.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-01-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"How can schools cultivate strong environmental consciousness in young children?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Highlight experiential environmental learning: community garden projects, recycling audits, field trips to conservation sanctuaries, and integrating ecological awareness into science curricula.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-01-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do some developing countries struggle to prioritize environmental protection over economic industrialization?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Address the immediate imperative to alleviate poverty, generate employment, and build essential infrastructure, which often clashes with costly long-term environmental regulations.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-02\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Difficult Skill You Successfully Mastered\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a difficult skill you learned and mastered.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the skill was and why you decided to learn it\",\n        \"How you approached learning and practicing it\",\n        \"What obstacles or frustrations you encountered\",\n        \"And explain how you felt once you achieved proficiency\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A challenging capability I set out to master was computer programming, specifically learning Python for data analysis and algorithmic problem solving. I embarked on this endeavor roughly two years ago because my academic research required handling substantial statistical data sets that traditional spreadsheet software could no longer process efficiently.\\n\\nTo acquire this competency, I enrolled in an intensive, project-based online certification course and instituted a disciplined daily habit of dedicating an hour every morning before work to coding drills. I applied theoretical syntax concepts immediately by writing custom automated scripts to scrape academic journals and clean messy empirical data.\\n\\nThe learning curve was exceptionally steep at the outset. I frequently encountered convoluted debugging errors, cryptic terminal messages, and logical algorithmic roadblocks that consumed entire evenings to resolve. There were numerous moments of acute imposter syndrome where the abstract nature of object-oriented programming felt utterly counterintuitive.\\n\\nHowever, through relentless perseverance and active participation in developer forums, the core concepts eventually coalesced. When I successfully deployed my first automated data pipeline that processed thousands of survey entries in seconds, I experienced an overwhelming sense of empowerment and intellectual triumph. Mastering this skill not only revolutionized my professional efficiency but also fundamentally reshaped how I decompose complex, ambiguous problems in daily life.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"challenging capability\",\n      \"steep learning curve\",\n      \"convoluted debugging errors\",\n      \"relentless perseverance\",\n      \"intellectual triumph\",\n      \"revolutionized my professional efficiency\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-02-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"What practical skills do you think will be most essential for workers in the next decade?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Emphasize digital literacy, prompt engineering with AI tools, dynamic adaptability, and human emotional intelligence (collaborative leadership and critical synthesis).\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-02-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Is it generally easier for children to acquire new skills compared to mature adults?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Contrast biological neuroplasticity and uninhibited risk-taking in children with superior metacognitive discipline, focused motivation, and analytical frameworks in adults.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-02-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How has the internet transformed the traditional master-apprentice model of learning?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss democratization of knowledge through interactive tutorials and global open-source communities, balanced against the enduring value of personalized mentorship.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-03\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Memorable Journey or Road Trip\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an unforgettable journey or road trip you took.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Where you traveled to and who accompanied you\",\n        \"What mode of transport you utilized\",\n        \"What memorable events occurred along the way\",\n        \"And explain why this particular journey remains so vivid in your memory\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"One of the most extraordinary expeditions I have ever undertaken was a five-day road trip through the rugged mountainous terrain of the Northern Highlands with two of my closest university friends. We embarked on this venture shortly after our final undergraduate examinations to decompress and celebrate our graduation.\\n\\nWe rented a sturdy four-wheel-drive vehicle, which proved indispensable given the winding switchbacks, unpaved gravel trails, and sudden altitude shifts. Setting out before dawn each day allowed us to witness mist-shrouded valleys gradually illuminated by the morning sun, creating awe-inspiring vistas at every mountain pass.\\n\\nA standout episode occurred on our third afternoon when a sudden torrential downpour triggered a localized mudslide, rendering the main coastal highway impassable. Compelled to detour through a secluded rural hamlet, we stumbled upon a family-run heritage tavern. The warm hospitable locals welcomed us like old friends, dried our soaked jackets beside a crackling hearth, and served us steaming bowls of hearty lamb broth and artisanal sourdough.\\n\\nThis trip remains indelibly etched in my recollection not merely because of the breathtaking geographical topography, but because it taught us the beauty of spontaneous detour. Far from adhering to a rigid itinerary, stepping into the unknown and sharing heartfelt conversations beneath star-strewn skies forged a profound emotional camaraderie that still endures today.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"extraordinary expedition\",\n      \"rugged mountainous terrain\",\n      \"awe-inspiring vistas\",\n      \"hospitable locals\",\n      \"indelibly etched in my recollection\",\n      \"profound emotional camaraderie\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-03-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do many young people prefer independent road trips over package holiday tours?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Contrast autonomous flexibility, spontaneous exploration, and authentic cultural immersion with the rigid schedules and commercialized itineraries of package tours.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-03-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"What impacts does mass tourism have on fragile indigenous and remote communities?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss economic windfalls and hospitality jobs versus environmental degradation, waste accumulation, commercialization of sacred traditions, and inflated local living costs.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-03-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How will future technological advancements, such as autonomous vehicles, change long-distance travel?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Predict reduced driver fatigue, enhanced vehicular safety, on-board mobile workspaces, and the democratization of road travel for elderly or mobility-impaired individuals.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-04\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Person Who Strongly Influenced You\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a person who has had an inspiring influence on your life.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Who this person is and how you know them\",\n        \"What qualities or achievements make them admirable\",\n        \"How they supported or influenced your personal development\",\n        \"And explain why their impact on you has been so profound\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"The person who has exerted the most profound and formative influence on my character is my maternal grandfather, a retired secondary school science educator who dedicated over four decades to rural community pedagogy. Growing up, I spent virtually every summer holiday at his modest countryside residence.\\n\\nWhat sets him apart is his boundless intellectual curiosity paired with genuine humility. Despite facing severe socioeconomic hardship in his youth, he taught himself three foreign languages, built his own astronomical telescope from scrap lenses, and treated every person he encountered with dignified empathy. His classroom philosophy was never about rote memorization; rather, he ignited a fiery passion for questioning dogmas and observing natural phenomena methodically.\\n\\nDuring my turbulent adolescence when I struggled with severe academic self-doubt, he never rebuked me. Instead, he would invite me on long evening walks through nearby pine groves, listening attentively without interruption before gently offering philosophical parables on resilience. He constantly reminded me that genuine intelligence is measured by one's capacity to bounce back from failure rather than immediate perfection.\\n\\nHis legacy has shaped my personal moral compass immensely. Whenever I confront ethical dilemmas or professional adversity today, I instinctively ask myself how he would navigate the circumstance with patience and grace. He instilled in me a lifelong reverence for scholarship, integrity, and quiet kindness that guides every milestone I pursue.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"formative influence\",\n      \"boundless intellectual curiosity\",\n      \"dignified empathy\",\n      \"philosophical parables on resilience\",\n      \"moral compass\",\n      \"lifelong reverence for scholarship\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-04-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Who exerts a greater influence on adolescent development: parents, peers, or public role models?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Analyze the shift: parental foundational values in early childhood give way to peer validation and conformity during adolescence, supplemented by social media influencers.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-04-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Do you believe celebrity influencers have a social duty to act as positive ethical role models?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Argue that having a massive impressionable platform confers ethical responsibility to avoid promoting consumerism, body dysmorphia, or harmful misinformation.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-04-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"What leadership traits are most vital for political or corporate leaders in times of national crisis?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Highlight transparent communication, decisive scientific grounding, empathetic accountability, and the ability to inspire collective solidarity under strain.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-05\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Cultural Festival or Traditional Celebration\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a traditional festival or cultural celebration in your country.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the festival is and when it takes place\",\n        \"What activities and customs people observe during it\",\n        \"What special foods or traditional attire are involved\",\n        \"And explain why this festival is culturally significant to you\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"I would like to describe the Mid-Autumn Lantern Festival, an ancient harvest celebration observed on the fifteenth night of the eighth lunar month when the full moon shines at its most luminous and radiant. It is an occasion fundamentally centered on kinship, thanksgiving, and family reunion.\\n\\nIn the days preceding the festival, bustling neighborhood markets are illuminated by thousands of intricately sculpted paper lanterns shaped like lotus blossoms, celestial dragons, and folkloric rabbits. On the festival eve, extended families gather for festive banquet dinners, after which children parade through city parks carrying vibrant lanterns, while elders recite classical poetry and gaze at the illuminated moon.\\n\\nThe culinary centerpiece is the traditional mooncake—a rich pastry emblazoned with auspicious calligraphy and filled with sweet lotus-seed paste surrounding salted duck egg yolks, which symbolize completeness and celestial harmony. People also brew aromatic osmanthus tea and share seasonal pomelo fruit.\\n\\nTo me, this celebration holds deep personal and spiritual resonance. In our hyper-accelerated modern society, where career demands frequently scatter relatives across different continents, the festival serves as an indispensable emotional anchor. Gazing up at the identical full moon that my ancestors celebrated centuries ago instills a profound sense of cultural continuity, belonging, and familial devotion.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"luminous and radiant\",\n      \"kinship and thanksgiving\",\n      \"intricately sculpted paper lanterns\",\n      \"culinary centerpiece\",\n      \"celestial harmony\",\n      \"cultural continuity and belonging\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-05-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Is it important for governments to preserve traditional folk festivals amidst global modernization?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Argue that preserving indigenous festivals protects cultural diversity, counters homogenization, boosts cultural tourism, and maintains community solidarity.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-05-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"How have commercialization and consumer marketing altered the authentic spirit of traditional holidays?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Critique how retail promotions reduce ancestral rituals to shopping sprees and gift packaging, while noting that marketing can paradoxically keep holidays visible to youth.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-05-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Why are Western celebrations like Halloween and Valentine's Day gaining popularity worldwide?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss global media streaming, corporate retail campaigns, and the fun, lighthearted, secular appeal of costuming and romance for young cosmopolitan audiences.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-06\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Piece of Technology You Find Indispensable\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a piece of technology that you rely on in daily life.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the device or application is\",\n        \"How frequently you use it and for what purposes\",\n        \"How you managed before you started using it\",\n        \"And explain why it has become so vital to you\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A technological innovation that has become an indispensable facet of my daily existence is my active noise-cancelling wireless headphones. I purchased them approximately three years ago, and they now accompany me virtually everywhere from morning subway commutes to evening study sessions.\\n\\nI utilize them continuously for six to eight hours a day. Beyond streaming podcasts and listening to acoustic melodies, their principal utility lies in creating a tranquil auditory sanctuary. By actively neutralizing low-frequency ambient rumble—such as train engines, air-conditioning hums, and bustling coffee shop chatter—they allow me to enter a state of deep cognitive flow during intensive academic writing.\\n\\nBefore acquiring this technology, I was chronically prone to sensory fatigue and auditory distraction. In shared open-plan offices or university libraries, the perpetual cacophony of ringing phones, clattering keyboards, and hallway conversations inevitably fragmented my concentration, necessitating frequent breaks and inducing mild tension headaches.\\n\\nThis device has transformed into an essential productivity instrument. In an increasingly dense, hyper-stimulating urban environment, having the capacity to instantaneously isolate my auditory senses and protect my mental bandwidth is genuinely priceless. It has substantially elevated my creative output and contributed tangibly to my psychological well-being.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"indispensable facet\",\n      \"tranquil auditory sanctuary\",\n      \"deep cognitive flow\",\n      \"sensory fatigue and distraction\",\n      \"perpetual cacophony\",\n      \"protect my mental bandwidth\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-06-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Do you believe wearable smart devices enhance our quality of life or foster excessive dependence?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Weigh real-time health diagnostics (heart rate, sleep tracking) against digital anxiety, constant notifications, and the erosion of analog presence.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-06-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"How can society address the digital divide between tech-savvy youth and elderly populations?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Propose community digital literacy workshops, intuitive simplified device UI design, dedicated family tutoring, and subsidized civic internet access.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-06-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"What ethical concerns arise from corporations harvesting personal biometric data from smart gadgets?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Examine surveillance capitalism, non-consensual targeted advertising, corporate data breaches, and the commodification of private behavioral health metrics.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-07\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Time You Helped Someone in Need\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an occasion when you helped someone or volunteered.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Who you assisted and what their situation was\",\n        \"What specific help you provided\",\n        \"What challenges arose while assisting them\",\n        \"And explain how you felt after providing this support\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An occasion when I provided meaningful assistance occurred last winter when I volunteered with a local municipal charity that delivers hot meals and emergency provisions to elderly residents during an unprecedented sub-zero cold snap. Specifically, I was assigned to support Mrs. Higgins, an eighty-four-year-old widow living alone on the third floor of an apartment complex without an elevator.\\n\\nDue to severe freezing rain and iced walkways, she was utterly unable to venture outside to purchase essential groceries or prescription arthritis medication. Over a three-week period, I visited her residence four times a week, delivering nutritious soups, de-icing her doorway, assisting with household chores, and ensuring her space heaters operated safely.\\n\\nThe principal difficulty was not the physical exertion of climbing stairwells in freezing wind, but navigating her initial reluctance to accept charity. Like many elderly individuals who cherish their independence, she felt embarrassed. I made a deliberate effort to sit down, converse with her over hot tea, and listen to her vivid stories about 1960s local history, thereby transforming our interaction from transactional charity into genuine reciprocal companionship.\\n\\nReflecting on that experience, I felt a deep sense of humility and fulfillment. It illuminated how easily vulnerable demographics can become invisible in modern urban centers, and reminded me that human compassion and active presence are often far more therapeutic than material donations alone.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"unprecedented cold snap\",\n      \"vulnerable demographics\",\n      \"initial reluctance to accept charity\",\n      \"reciprocal companionship\",\n      \"deep sense of humility\",\n      \"human compassion and active presence\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-07-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Should high schools make community volunteer service a mandatory graduation requirement?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Weigh civic empathy, social awareness, and character building against the risk of turning altruism into a cynical box-ticking exercise.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-07-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Why are some people reluctant to assist strangers in emergency public situations?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Cite the psychological bystander effect (diffusion of responsibility), fear of physical liability, personal safety risks, and urban social detachment.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-07-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How can charitable organizations ensure that financial donations reach beneficiaries transparently?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Recommend independent financial audits, blockchain-enabled transparent tracking, capped administrative overhead ratios, and published public impact metrics.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-08\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Historical Site or Monument You Visited\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a historical building, monument, or heritage site you visited.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Where the site is located and when you traveled there\",\n        \"What architectural or historical features stood out\",\n        \"What you learned about its past significance\",\n        \"And explain how visiting this site impacted your perspective\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A historical monument that made an indelible impression on me is the ancient fortified citadel of Alhambra, nestled on a forested hill overlooking the city of Granada in southern Spain. I had the privilege of exploring this UNESCO World Heritage complex two summers ago during an architectural study tour.\\n\\nThe citadel is renowned for its breathtaking Moorish architecture, characterized by intricate geometric arabesque stuccowork, delicate horseshoe arches, and courtyards engineered around running water. The Court of the Lions, with its central marble fountain supported by twelve sculpted lions, stands as a crowning engineering masterpiece of hydraulic balance and tranquil symmetry.\\n\\nLearning about its layered history was deeply illuminating. Built in the thirteenth century by the Nasrid dynasty, it served as both a royal palace and military bastion before its surrender in 1492. What captivated me was how Islamic, Christian, and Jewish craftsmen worked in harmonious cultural synthesis, producing an aesthetic that bridged East and West.\\n\\nWandering through those sunlit halls instilled in me a profound reverence for ancient craftsmanship and tolerance. Standing where civilizations converged centuries ago was a humbling reminder that human culture flourishes through dialogue and exchange rather than isolation. It remains one of the most culturally enriching experiences of my life.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"indelible impression\",\n      \"UNESCO World Heritage complex\",\n      \"intricate geometric arabesque\",\n      \"hydraulic balance and tranquil symmetry\",\n      \"harmonious cultural synthesis\",\n      \"profound reverence for ancient craftsmanship\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-08-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Should governments invest significant taxpayer funds into restoring ancient monuments when public services need funding?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Argue that historical monuments embody civic identity, generate long-term tourism revenue, and preserve collective cultural memory, justifying balanced public investment.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-08-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"How can modern museums make historical exhibits engaging for digital-native youth?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Suggest augmented reality recreations, interactive touchscreens, gamified historical treasure hunts, and immersive 3D soundscapes.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-08-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"What are the primary threats facing ancient heritage sites across the globe today?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Highlight mass overtourism (wear and tear), acid rain and atmospheric pollution, armed conflict destruction, and climate-induced extreme weather.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-09\",\n    \"topic\": \"An Ambitious Goal You Worked Hard to Achieve\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an ambitious goal you set for yourself and achieved.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the goal was and when you committed to it\",\n        \"What preparation, training, or steps were necessary\",\n        \"What doubts or difficulties you had to overcome\",\n        \"And explain how achieving this goal influenced your self-confidence\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An ambitious personal objective that tested my limits was preparing for and successfully completing a full 42-kilometer marathon. I committed to this challenge eighteen months ago, having lived a largely sedentary lifestyle throughout university.\\n\\nAchieving this required a rigorous, non-negotiable six-month training regimen. I adhered to a phased schedule incorporating five running sessions per week, encompassing high-intensity interval track workouts, recovery jogs, and grueling long runs every Sunday morning that gradually increased to 35 kilometers. I had to radically overhaul my nutritional intake, prioritize restorative sleep, and give up late-night social outings.\\n\\nThe journey was fraught with physical and mental hurdles. At the halfway mark, I suffered chronic shin splints and knee inflammation that forced me to cross-train in a swimming pool for two weeks. The insidious psychological voice telling me I was fundamentally not an endurance athlete was constant, especially during freezing, rain-soaked 5 AM winter training runs.\\n\\nHowever, crossing the finish line after four hours and twelve minutes of relentless exertion was a transcendent milestone. Hearing the roaring crowd and having that finisher medal placed around my neck dissolved months of self-doubt. It proved to me unequivocally that discipline and consistent micro-efforts can overcome seemingly insurmountable barriers.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"ambitious personal objective\",\n      \"rigorous training regimen\",\n      \"grueling long runs\",\n      \"fraught with physical hurdles\",\n      \"transcendent milestone\",\n      \"seemingly insurmountable barriers\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-09-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do some individuals struggle to sustain motivation when pursuing long-term goals?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Analyze the bias toward instant gratification, lack of intermediate milestone feedback, vague goal definition, and burnout from unsustainable pacing.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-09-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Is it healthier to focus on ambitious outcomes or on daily process habits?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Advocate for process-driven habits: while an ambitious target sets direction, daily consistent execution builds self-efficacy and prevents despair.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-09-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How can parents teach children resilience in the face of inevitable academic or athletic defeat?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Recommend praising effort over innate talent, reframing mistakes as diagnostic learning data, and modeling healthy emotional coping during setbacks.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-10\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Book or Novel That Left a Lasting Impression\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a book or novel that profoundly influenced your thinking.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the book was and who authored it\",\n        \"What the central plot or core argument was\",\n        \"Why you decided to read it\",\n        \"And explain what lasting insights or lessons you took away from it\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A literary work that exerted a transformative impact on my perspective is 'Man's Search for Meaning', an autobiographical and psychological treatise authored by the Austrian neurologist and psychiatrist Viktor Frankl. I picked up this volume during a period of existential uncertainty during my final college year.\\n\\nThe first half of the book chronicles Frankl's harrowing survival in Nazi concentration camps, detailing the psychological degradation and inhumane atrocities endured by inmates. Rather than succumbing to despair, Frankl observed that prisoners who identified a tangible purpose—whether reuniting with a loved one, completing an unfinished manuscript, or holding onto spiritual faith—displayed extraordinary resilience against death.\\n\\nThe second portion introduces logotherapy, his therapeutic framework asserting that the primary human drive is not the pursuit of pleasure or power, but the discovery of personal meaning. What struck me most was his profound assertion that while humans cannot always control their external circumstances, we preserve the ultimate freedom to choose our attitude in any given circumstance.\\n\\nReading this masterpiece fundamentally recalibrated my approach to life's inevitable tribulations. Whenever I encounter trivial daily irritations or professional stress, I remind myself of Frankl's wisdom: suffering ceases to be suffering the moment it finds a purpose. It taught me gratitude, psychological fortitude, and empathy.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"transformative impact\",\n      \"harrowing survival\",\n      \"extraordinary resilience\",\n      \"existential uncertainty\",\n      \"ultimate freedom to choose our attitude\",\n      \"psychological fortitude\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-10-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Do you believe physical printed books will eventually disappear as digital audiobooks and e-readers advance?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Argue that printed books will endure as prized physical artifacts, aesthetic home decor, and distraction-free cognitive sanctuaries, even as digital formats grow.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-10-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"What are the intellectual advantages of reading long-form literature over short social media articles?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Highlight sustained attentional endurance, cognitive empathy through narrative theory of mind, rich lexical acquisition, and complex thematic synthesis.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-10-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Should school literature curricula mandate classical historical texts or contemporary modern novels?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Propose a hybrid balance: classical literature connects youth to universal human themes, while modern novels reflect contemporary diverse social realities.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-11\",\n    \"topic\": \"An Outdoor Activity You Tried for the First Time\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an outdoor activity or sport you tried for the first time.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the activity was and where you did it\",\n        \"Who invited or coached you\",\n        \"What physical or mental skills it required\",\n        \"And explain whether you would like to continue doing it\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An outdoor pursuit I experienced for the first time last autumn was open-water sea kayaking along the rocky limestone coast of a coastal national park. I was introduced to this sport by a veteran outdoor instructor friend who organized a weekend beginner expedition.\\n\\nBefore launching into the surf, we received an intensive safety briefing on paddling mechanics, capsizing recovery drills, and navigating tidal currents. Once on the water, the activity demanded continuous core stabilization, rhythmic upper-body endurance, and sharp situational awareness of incoming ocean swells.\\n\\nInitially, I felt quite intimidated by the sheer power of the rolling waves and the vulnerability of being seated mere inches above the deep ocean surface. My arms burned with lactic acid, and coordinating steering with foot pedals took substantial trial and error. However, as we paddled past towering coastal sea caves and watched seabirds diving into crystal-clear turquoise waters, fear gave way to pure exhilaration.\\n\\nI found the experience immensely therapeutic. Unlike indoor gym workouts, kayaking immerses you completely in the raw elemental rhythm of nature. It disconnected me entirely from digital notifications and gave me a deep cardiovascular challenge. I have already signed up for an advanced coastal navigation course to continue pursuing it regularly.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"open-water sea kayaking\",\n      \"rhythmic upper-body endurance\",\n      \"situational awareness\",\n      \"fear gave way to pure exhilaration\",\n      \"raw elemental rhythm of nature\",\n      \"cardiovascular challenge\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-11-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why are extreme and adventure sports becoming increasingly popular among young adults?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss escaping sedentary sterile office routines, seeking dopamine-rich visceral adrenaline, and showcasing adventurous lifestyles on digital media.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-11-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"What responsibilities do national park authorities have to protect inexperienced outdoor adventurers?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Mention trail warning markers, mandatory registration for perilous routes, rapid rescue helplines, and deploying trained ranger patrols.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-11-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How does immersion in natural wilderness benefit human psychological health?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Cite empirical studies on nature therapy: lowering salivary cortisol, reducing rumination, restoring directed attention, and inducing awe.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-12\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Time You Successfully Resolved a Disagreement\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a time you resolved a conflict or disagreement with someone.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Who the disagreement was with and what caused it\",\n        \"How both parties communicated during the conflict\",\n        \"What compromise or solution was reached\",\n        \"And explain what you learned about conflict resolution\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A significant disagreement I had to navigate occurred during my final-year university capstone project with my team co-leader. We had reached a complete impasse regarding the methodological direction of our thesis.\\n\\nMy colleague wanted to rely exclusively on automated quantitative surveys because it would yield a large sample size quickly. In contrast, I strongly argued that without in-depth qualitative interviews, our findings would lack interpretive depth. As project deadlines loomed, tensions escalated, and our team meetings became uncomfortably defensive and unproductive.\\n\\nRecognizing that our stubbornness was jeopardizing the entire group's grade, I initiated a neutral conversation over coffee outside the academic building. Instead of reiterating my arguments, I practiced active listening, asking him to explain his core concerns. He revealed that he was terrified of failing our timeline due to his heavy workload in other subjects.\\n\\nOnce his underlying anxiety was out in the open, we formulated a pragmatic hybrid methodology: he managed a streamlined quantitative survey, while I took full ownership of conducting and coding six detailed stakeholder interviews. By clarifying deliverables and validating each other's constraints, we submitted an honors-grade project. This taught me that interpersonal conflict is rarely about the stated topic; it is usually driven by unspoken fears that require empathy to unlock.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"reached a complete impasse\",\n      \"interpretive depth\",\n      \"defensive and unproductive\",\n      \"practiced active listening\",\n      \"pragmatic hybrid methodology\",\n      \"empathy to unlock\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-12-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"What communication techniques are most effective in defusing workplace conflicts?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Focus on non-violent communication: using 'I' statements, separating individuals from the problem, establishing mutual objectives, and emotional self-regulation.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-12-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do minor disagreements between colleagues sometimes spiral into destructive office politics?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Address ego preservation, insecure middle management, lack of psychological safety, and toxic gossip channels that amplify tribalism.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-12-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Is conflict avoidance generally beneficial or detrimental in long-term relationships?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Argue that chronic conflict avoidance breeds toxic resentment and passive aggression; constructive, respectful friction is necessary for authentic intimacy.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-13\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Local Business or Family Restaurant You Admire\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a local independent business or family restaurant you respect.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Where the business is located and what products or services it offers\",\n        \"Who runs it and how long you have frequented it\",\n        \"What makes it distinctive compared to large chain competitors\",\n        \"And explain why you feel it deserves continued community patronage\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A neighborhood enterprise that holds a special place in my heart is 'The Corner Crumb', an artisanal sourdough bakery and cafe situated on the corner of my residential street. It is operated by an elderly couple, Marco and Elena, who founded the establishment over twenty-five years ago.\\n\\nThey specialize in slow-fermented organic breads, traditional pastries, and locally roasted coffee. I have been a loyal weekly patron for the past four years, frequently dropping in for a warm cinnamon bun and a double espresso every Saturday morning.\\n\\nWhat sets this bakery apart from massive commercial supermarket chains is their uncompromising devotion to quality and personal warmth. Marco meticulously ferments his dough for thirty-six hours without artificial preservatives, resulting in crusts that are golden and crunchy with light, airy crumb structures. Moreover, Elena remembers the names, professions, and family milestones of virtually every customer who walks through the threshold.\\n\\nIn an age dominated by sterile, homogenized corporate franchises, family-run establishments like this serve as the vital social glue of neighborhood life. They source ingredients from regional farmers and donate unsold loaves to local food banks at dusk. Supporting them is not just about enjoying superior gastronomy; it is about preserving community soul.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"artisanal sourdough bakery\",\n      \"loyal weekly patron\",\n      \"uncompromising devotion to quality\",\n      \"homogenized corporate franchises\",\n      \"vital social glue of neighborhood life\",\n      \"preserving community soul\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-13-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"How can independent local businesses survive in competition against massive e-commerce and retail giants?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Recommend hyper-personalized customer service, unique artisanal niche curation, hosting in-person community events, and adopting local delivery platforms.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-13-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"What role do local high street shops play in fostering neighborhood safety and social cohesion?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Cite Jane Jacobs' 'eyes on the street' theory: active storefronts create vibrant pedestrian foot traffic, natural surveillance, and informal social check-ins.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-13-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Should municipal governments provide tax incentives to protect mom-and-pop stores from gentrification?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Support targeted commercial rent controls or tax credits to prevent monocultural gentrification and ensure affordable local goods remain accessible.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-14\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Public Speech or Presentation You Listened to\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an inspiring speech or public presentation you listened to.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Who delivered the speech and what the occasion was\",\n        \"What the core theme or message was\",\n        \"How the speaker engaged the audience\",\n        \"And explain why their presentation had such an impact on you\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An extraordinary presentation that remains etched in my mind was a keynote address delivered by Dr. Jane Goodall, the world-renowned primatologist and anthropologist, which I attended during a conservation summit at our university auditorium three years ago.\\n\\nThe overarching theme of her address was 'Reasons for Hope in an Age of Ecological Crisis'. Addressing an audience of over a thousand students and academics, she recounted her pioneering field research with wild chimpanzees in Gombe, Tanzania, detailing how ecological balance relies on interconnected biodiversity.\\n\\nHer delivery was breathtakingly magnetic. She did not rely on flashy digital slides or dense statistics. Instead, she stood alone at the podium, speaking with a serene yet commanding cadence, opening her speech with an uncanny, authentic chimpanzee pant-hoot greeting that electrified the auditorium. She seamlessly wove heartbreaking stories of deforestation with uplifting accounts of grassroots youth activism worldwide.\\n\\nHer message deeply moved me because it rejected cynical defeatism. Rather than paralyzing the audience with catastrophic climate statistics, she empowered each listener by emphasizing that every single day, our purchasing choices, dietary habits, and ethical stances make an indelible impact on the planet. I walked out of that auditorium with renewed purpose and commitment to environmental stewardship.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"keynote address\",\n      \"breathtakingly magnetic\",\n      \"serene yet commanding cadence\",\n      \"grassroots youth activism\",\n      \"rejected cynical defeatism\",\n      \"environmental stewardship\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-14-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"What elements distinguish an exceptional public speaker from an average presenter?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Highlight storytelling authenticity, dynamic vocal modulation, receptive body language, active pauses, and emotional empathy with audience values.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-14-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do so many people suffer from intense glossophobia (fear of public speaking)?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Explain evolutionary roots of fear of social rejection/ostracism, fear of perceived incompetence, and lack of systematic practice in school.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-14-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How has the rise of short video platforms (like TikTok) affected the public's attention span for long speeches?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss shortened attention spans necessitating punchier hooks, while noting the continued popularity of 60-minute long-form podcasts and TED talks.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-15\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Piece of Art, Sculpture, or Photograph That Captivated You\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a work of art, painting, or photograph that moved you.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the artwork is and who created it\",\n        \"Where you saw it for the first time\",\n        \"What visual details or techniques captured your attention\",\n        \"And explain why this particular piece evoked strong emotions\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A visual masterpiece that profoundly captivated me is 'The Starry Night', painted by Vincent van Gogh in June 1889. I had the privilege of viewing the original canvas in person at the Museum of Modern Art in New York during a family visit.\\n\\nThe painting depicts an expressive nocturnal landscape dominated by a swirling, turbulent celestial sky filled with incandescent yellow stars and a radiant crescent moon. In the foreground stands an imposing, flame-like dark cypress tree rising dramatically against the quiet, sleepy village of Saint-Rémy nestled beneath the rolling hills.\\n\\nWhat seized my attention was the visceral impasto technique. Standing inches away, one can clearly observe the thick, sculpted ridges of oil paint applied with intense, rhythmic brushstrokes that create an almost hypnotic sense of fluid motion. The vibrant contrast between the deep cobalt blues and the explosive golden orbs radiates raw spiritual energy.\\n\\nKnowing that Van Gogh created this while sequestered in an asylum during a profound mental health crisis made the experience deeply poignant. It demonstrated how immense internal anguish could be sublimated into sublime, transcendent beauty. Viewing that canvas reminded me of the enduring resilience of the creative human spirit.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"expressive nocturnal landscape\",\n      \"incandescent yellow stars\",\n      \"visceral impasto technique\",\n      \"hypnotic sense of fluid motion\",\n      \"deeply poignant\",\n      \"transcendent beauty\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-15-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Can computer algorithms and generative AI create genuine art with authentic emotional depth?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Argue that while AI can synthesize stunning visual aesthetics, genuine art requires lived human consciousness, vulnerability, mortality, and intentional struggle.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-15-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Why is abstract art often misunderstood or criticized by the general public?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Explain the public expectation of photographic realism vs abstract art's focus on non-representational emotion, color theory, and conceptual provocation.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-15-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Should public tax money be used to fund modern art installations in city streets?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Affirm that public street sculptures democratize art access, foster urban civic pride, stimulate cultural dialogue, and enhance architectural beauty.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-16\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Time You Had to Adapt to Sudden Change\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a time you had to adapt quickly to an unexpected change.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the change or disruption was\",\n        \"Why it occurred unexpectedly\",\n        \"How you responded and adjusted your plans\",\n        \"And explain what this experience taught you about adaptability\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An unexpected disruption that demanded rapid adaptation occurred at the start of my university exchange semester abroad. Three days after arriving in an unfamiliar European city, the entire institution announced an emergency transition to remote digital instruction due to public health mandates, closing all campus housing.\\n\\nSuddenly, I was stranded in a foreign jurisdiction without permanent accommodation, unable to speak the local language fluently, and facing the immediate cancellation of my pre-arranged dormitory. It was an intensely disorienting and stressful circumstance.\\n\\nRather than panicking, I broke the emergency into manageable tactical steps. I spent forty-eight hours scouring student forums, contacting local youth hostels, and successfully negotiated a short-term shared flat with two other stranded international students. We established a communal kitchen, synchronized our remote learning study schedules, and formed a tight-knit support network to navigate local emergency regulations.\\n\\nThis trial was a masterclass in psychological resilience. It forced me completely out of my comfort zone, stripped away my reliance on familiar institutional scaffolds, and taught me that rigid expectations are the enemy of peace in a volatile world. I developed an agile mindset and self-reliance that continue to anchor my career today.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"rapid adaptation\",\n      \"intensely disorienting\",\n      \"manageable tactical steps\",\n      \"tight-knit support network\",\n      \"masterclass in psychological resilience\",\n      \"agile mindset and self-reliance\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-16-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do many employees experience intense stress when corporate restructurings occur?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Address fear of job displacement, disruption of familiar daily routines, loss of status, and poor management transparency during transitions.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-16-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"How can modern educational systems train students to be more adaptable in an uncertain economy?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Advocate for problem-based interdisciplinary learning, fostering growth mindsets, teaching iterative design, and de-emphasizing rote exam answers.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-16-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Is adaptability a purely innate personality trait or can it be systematically cultivated?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Argue that while temperament plays a role, cognitive reframing, deliberate exposure to novel challenges, and stress inoculation build adaptability.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-17\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Teacher or Mentor Who Inspired You\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an outstanding teacher or mentor who influenced your education.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Who the teacher was and what subject they taught\",\n        \"What distinctive teaching methods they employed\",\n        \"How they supported or encouraged you individually\",\n        \"And explain why they left such a lasting impression\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"The educator who left an indelible stamp on my intellectual trajectory was Mrs. Henderson, my high school English literature instructor during my junior and senior years.\\n\\nWhat made her teaching truly extraordinary was her refusal to treat literary texts as static exam material. Instead of assigning dry comprehension worksheets, she transformed our classroom into a vibrant philosophical forum. She would rearrange the desks into a circle, pose provocative moral dilemmas embedded in Shakespearean tragedies or Orwellian allegories, and challenge us to defend our stances using textual evidence.\\n\\nOn an individual level, she recognized my latent passion for essay writing before I even acknowledged it myself. When I submitted a mediocre, formulaic essay, she did not merely award a grade; she scheduled a twenty-minute consultation, dissected my arguments line by line with warm encouragement, and urged me to find my own authentic, courageous voice rather than parroting generic commentary.\\n\\nHer mentorship demystified critical thinking for me. She taught me that analytical reading is not merely an academic exercise, but a lifelong tool to interrogate societal dogmas and understand human empathy. The confidence she nurtured in my analytical writing became the foundation of my entire academic career.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"intellectual trajectory\",\n      \"vibrant philosophical forum\",\n      \"provocative moral dilemmas\",\n      \"authentic courageous voice\",\n      \"demystified critical thinking\",\n      \"interrogate societal dogmas\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-17-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"What qualities make a truly memorable teacher compared to someone who merely delivers facts?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Highlight emotional passion for the discipline, genuine empathy for students' personal struggles, adaptability in pacing, and the ability to inspire curiosity.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-17-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Can automated AI tutors ever replace the pastoral mentorship of human schoolteachers?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Reiterate that while AI provides 24/7 factual drill customization, it cannot provide emotional solace, ethical role modeling, or instill moral character.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-17-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Why is the teaching profession often undervalued in terms of remuneration across many societies?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Analyze public sector fiscal constraints, historical gender biases associated with caregiving professions, and the delayed non-monetary nature of educational returns.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-18\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Crowded Place You Visited\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an energetic and crowded place you visited.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Where the place was and why you were there\",\n        \"What the environment, sights, and sounds were like\",\n        \"What you did while you were in the crowd\",\n        \"And explain how you felt about being in that crowded atmosphere\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An extraordinarily vibrant, bustling environment I experienced was the famous Shilin Night Market in Taipei, which I explored on a Saturday evening during a backpacking trip across East Asia.\\n\\nThe sensory intensity was staggering. The narrow maze of pedestrian alleys was packed shoulder-to-shoulder with hundreds of eager food lovers, street vendors, and tourists. Bright neon signs illuminated billows of aromatic steam rising from hot oil woks, while the rhythmic calls of hawkers mingled with the sizzling sound of frying oyster omelets and pepper buns.\\n\\nNavigating through the crowd required patience and drifting with the human tide. We sampled iconic culinary street delicacies, tried traditional carnival arcade games with colorful balloons, and observed local artisans crafting handmade calligraphy trinkets. Every few yards revealed an enticing new aroma or a curious culinary specialty.\\n\\nWhile being in such a dense crowd can occasionally feel overwhelming, that evening it felt utterly exhilarating. There was an infectious, celebratory communal warmth in the air. Seeing families, teenagers, and travelers sharing street-side tables and laughing over delicious food showed the beauty of vibrant urban public life. It was a sensory celebration I will never forget.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"sensory intensity was staggering\",\n      \"maze of pedestrian alleys\",\n      \"rhythmic calls of hawkers\",\n      \"drifting with the human tide\",\n      \"infectious communal warmth\",\n      \"vibrant urban public life\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-18-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do some people thrive in crowded urban centers while others find them unbearable?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Contrast extraversion and desire for social stimulation/convenience with introversion, sensory sensitivity, and the need for natural space.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-18-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"What municipal urban planning strategies can prevent severe pedestrian and vehicular congestion in mega-cities?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Recommend decentralized mixed-use zoning (15-minute city model), robust pedestrianized transit corridors, congestion pricing, and staggered work hours.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-18-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How has the experience of crowded public gatherings changed following global health pandemics?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss heightened hygiene sensitivity, touchless ticketing, improved indoor air filtration, and occasional lingering social anxiety in tight spaces.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-19\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Film or Documentary That Changed Your Perspective\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a documentary or movie that altered your worldview.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the film was and what subject it covered\",\n        \"When and where you watched it\",\n        \"What key evidence or dramatic scenes impacted you\",\n        \"And explain why it changed your opinion or behavior\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A documentary that fundamentally recalibrated my lifestyle habits was 'The Social Dilemma', directed by Jeff Orlowski and released on a global streaming platform. I watched it three years ago on a quiet Sunday evening at home.\\n\\nThe film meticulously examines the psychological manipulation engineered into modern social media algorithms, featuring interviews with former senior design executives and data engineers from leading Silicon Valley tech conglomerates. It reveals how digital platforms are deliberately designed using persuasive behavioral psychology—such as intermittent dopamine reinforcement—to maximize screen addiction and monetize user attention.\\n\\nThe most chilling sequence showed how algorithmic recommendation engines create hyper-polarized echo chambers, serving users sensationalized conspiracy theories to keep them engaged, thereby fracturing democratic discourse and accelerating adolescent depression.\\n\\nWatching this documentary was an acute wake-up call. I suddenly realized that my frequent phone-checking was not a personal lack of willpower, but the calculated result of algorithmic design. Immediately after the credits rolled, I disabled all non-human notifications, removed infinite-scroll apps from my home screen, and set strict daily digital boundaries. It restored my focus and made me a conscious consumer of technology.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"psychological manipulation\",\n      \"persuasive behavioral psychology\",\n      \"intermittent dopamine reinforcement\",\n      \"hyper-polarized echo chambers\",\n      \"acute wake-up call\",\n      \"conscious consumer of technology\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-19-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Are documentary films more effective at raising public awareness than written investigative journalism?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Contrast the visceral emotional empathy of cinematic imagery and sound with the comprehensive analytical depth and factual scrutiny of long-form journalism.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-19-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Should streaming platforms be held legally liable if their recommendation algorithms promote dangerous misinformation?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Debate free speech protections versus public harm prevention, corporate algorithmic accountability, and establishing independent regulatory oversight.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-19-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do dystopian and apocalyptic movies enjoy such enduring popularity among audiences?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Explain psychological catharsis: confronting societal anxieties (climate collapse, AI takeover) in a safe narrative environment to process collective fears.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-20\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Law or Regulation You Agree With\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a civic rule, law, or regulation you strongly support.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the rule or law is\",\n        \"Why it was enacted and what it requires citizens to do\",\n        \"How well it is enforced in practice\",\n        \"And explain why you consider this law beneficial for society\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A public health regulation that I whole-heartedly endorse is the comprehensive ban on smoking in enclosed public spaces, including restaurants, bars, public transit stations, and workplaces, which was enacted in my country roughly a decade ago.\\n\\nThe legislation was introduced primarily to eliminate involuntary exposure to secondhand tobacco smoke, which medical evidence has conclusively proven causes lung cancer, heart disease, and pediatric asthma. It mandates that anyone wishing to smoke must do so in designated outdoor zones well away from building entrances.\\n\\nIn my city, compliance is exceptionally high. Initial resistance from hospitality owners who feared losing business dissipated within months, as non-smokers and families flooded into cleaner, smoke-free establishments. Clear municipal signage and meaningful fines for non-compliant venues have ensured robust enforcement.\\n\\nI consider this law an exemplary model of public health policy. It strikes the right balance between personal freedom and public harm reduction: adults retain the legal liberty to smoke privately, but lose the right to pollute shared air breathed by service workers and patrons. It has measurably decreased respiratory admissions and denormalized smoking for the younger generation.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"whole-heartedly endorse\",\n      \"involuntary exposure to secondhand smoke\",\n      \"compliance is exceptionally high\",\n      \"exemplary model of public health policy\",\n      \"personal freedom and public harm reduction\",\n      \"denormalized smoking\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-20-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Where should the boundary lie between state regulation for public safety and individual personal liberty?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Apply John Stuart Mill's harm principle: the state is justified in restricting individual action only when that action directly harms or endangers others.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-20-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do some well-intended environmental or traffic laws face widespread public non-compliance?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss lack of public buy-in, perceived hypocrisy of governing elites, punitive fines without viable transit alternatives, and weak enforcement.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-20-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How will lawmakers regulate emerging autonomous technologies like self-driving cars or AI tools?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Emphasize adaptive regulatory sandboxes, establishing clear corporate legal liability frameworks, and updating ethical safety standards.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-21\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Meaningful Gift You Chose for Someone\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a thoughtful gift that took you a long time to choose.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Who the gift was for and what occasion it marked\",\n        \"What the gift was and how you decided on it\",\n        \"What effort or research was required to obtain it\",\n        \"And explain why this gift was so meaningful to both of you\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A present that required extensive thought was a vintage 1970s acoustic vinyl record player that I sourced for my father's sixtieth birthday last year.\\n\\nMy father had been an avid record collector in his youth, but during our family's cross-country relocation two decades ago, his audio turntable was damaged and never replaced. His vintage record collection had sat untouched in our attic for years.\\n\\nTracking down a fully restored vintage turntable with warm analog vacuum-tube amplification proved to be a meticulous scavenger hunt. I spent weeks scouring specialized audiophile forums, consulting with vintage audio restoration technicians, and eventually acquired a beautifully preserved mahogany-trimmed unit from a collector three cities away. I also secretly cleaned all of his old classic rock and jazz vinyl records.\\n\\nWhen he unwrapped the turntable on his birthday, he was visibly moved to tears. We spent the entire evening listening to his original 1975 Pink Floyd album, with the warm crackle of the needle filling the living room. It was not merely a mechanical gadget; it was a portal to his youth and a symbol of our shared gratitude for his sacrifices.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"extensive thought\",\n      \"avid record collector\",\n      \"meticulous scavenger hunt\",\n      \"audiophile forums\",\n      \"visibly moved to tears\",\n      \"portal to his youth\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-21-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Do you believe commercial marketing has degraded the authentic sentimental value of gift-giving?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Acknowledge intense corporate commercialization (Black Friday, Christmas sales), while emphasizing that bespoke, personalized gifts retain genuine emotional warmth.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-21-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Is it more meaningful to give tangible physical objects or experiential gifts (like concert tickets or travel)?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Advocate for experiential gifts: psychological research shows shared memories provide deeper long-term happiness and avoid material clutter.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-21-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How do gift-giving customs vary across different cultural traditions?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Contrast Western focus on unwrapping individual surprises with East Asian customs of ceremonial red envelopes (cash) and etiquette regarding taboo items (clocks, sharp objects).\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-22\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Time You Got Lost in an Unfamiliar Place\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a time you lost your way in an unfamiliar place.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Where you were and how you came to be lost\",\n        \"What you did to try to find your direction\",\n        \"Who helped you or how you navigated back\",\n        \"And explain how you felt during and after the ordeal\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An occasion when I was completely disoriented occurred three years ago in Venice, Italy, while exploring the historic Cannaregio district at dusk.\\n\\nVenice is infamous for its labyrinthine network of narrow alleys, footbridges, and dead-end canals. Intending to take a picturesque shortcut back to my hotel near the Grand Canal, my smartphone battery abruptly died. Without digital GPS or a printed map, every cobblestone passage began looking identical under the dim streetlamps, and within twenty minutes I was hopelessly lost.\\n\\nInitially, panic began to rise as darkness fell and the tourist crowds vanished. Realizing wandering aimlessly was futile, I stepped inside an illuminated local bakery where an elderly baker was kneading bread. Despite our language barrier, I pointed toward a canal sketch and named the famous Rialto Bridge. With warm smiles and expressive gestures, he led me to the street corner and pointed out the yellow navigational markers painted high on the historic stucco walls that guide pedestrians.\\n\\nFollowing his guidance, I reached the Grand Canal half an hour later. That experience was a salutary lesson. While losing your bearings can be unnerving, it also forced me to look up, engage with the local community, and observe the hidden charm of an ancient city that tourists glued to mobile screens often miss entirely.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"completely disoriented\",\n      \"labyrinthine network of narrow alleys\",\n      \"wandering aimlessly was futile\",\n      \"language barrier\",\n      \"salutary lesson\",\n      \"losing your bearings\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-22-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"How has our reliance on satellite GPS navigation affected human spatial memory and sense of direction?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss cognitive offloading: over-reliance on turn-by-turn prompts weakens mental mapping and hippocampus spatial orientation compared to analog navigation.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-22-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do some intrepid travelers deliberately seek to get lost when visiting new cities?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Explain the concept of 'flânerie': discovering authentic local neighborhoods, hidden eateries, and unplanned encounters away from sanitized tourist traps.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-22-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"What safety precautions should international solo travelers adopt when exploring unfamiliar urban centers?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Recommend offline downloaded maps, carrying an emergency paper hotel address card, keeping an external power bank, and remaining mindful of local neighborhood safety.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-23\",\n    \"topic\": \"An Interesting Conversation with an Elderly Person\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a memorable conversation you had with an elderly person.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Who the elderly person was and where you met\",\n        \"What topics you discussed together\",\n        \"What perspectives or life stories they shared\",\n        \"And explain why this dialogue left an impression on you\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A deeply memorable conversation I had was with a ninety-two-year-old gentleman named Mr. Arthur Chen, whom I met on a long-distance cross-country train journey two summers ago. We happened to be seated across from each other in the observation lounge.\\n\\nOur conversation commenced with casual remarks about the passing countryside, but quickly deepened into an absorbing dialogue spanning over three hours. Mr. Chen was a retired civil engineer who had helped construct some of the country's earliest hydroelectric dams and railway tunnels in the 1960s.\\n\\nHe shared vivid eyewitness accounts of historical milestones—from living through wartime food rationing in his childhood to witnessing the birth of the computer age. What moved me was his perspective on technological acceleration. Rather than being nostalgic, he marveled at modern medical science and global connectivity, yet he gently cautioned against the modern illusion of hurried impatience.\\n\\nHe remarked: 'Young people today run so fast toward the next milestone that they forget that life is made of the journey itself.' His tranquility, sharp intellect, and utter lack of bitterness despite surviving immense historical hardships provided an invaluable lesson. It taught me that wisdom comes from deep self-acceptance and that intergenerational dialogues are precious bridges across time.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"absorbing dialogue\",\n      \"eyewitness accounts of historical milestones\",\n      \"technological acceleration\",\n      \"modern illusion of hurried impatience\",\n      \"intergenerational dialogues\",\n      \"precious bridges across time\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-23-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why are traditional extended multi-generational households becoming less common in urbanized societies?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss smaller urban apartment sizes, career mobility necessitating geographic relocation, and a cultural shift toward individualism and privacy.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-23-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"What can modern communities do to combat social isolation among retired senior citizens?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Suggest intergenerational community centers (co-locating kindergartens and senior care), volunteer mentorship programs, and local accessible transit.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-23-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"What valuable life perspectives can younger generations uniquely learn from the elderly?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Highlight long-term historical perspective, emotional resilience through adversity, the relativity of material status, and prioritization of family.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-24\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Healthy Habit You Developed\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a positive habit you built to improve your wellness or productivity.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the habit is and when you adopted it\",\n        \"How you integrated it into your daily routine\",\n        \"What difficulties you encountered when forming it\",\n        \"And explain what tangible benefits it has brought to your life\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A habit that has exerted a profound positive impact on my health and productivity is daily morning mindfulness meditation. I adopted this practice approximately eighteen months ago during a phase of intense work burnout and cognitive overload.\\n\\nI committed to an unbendable rule: meditating for fifteen minutes immediately upon waking, before checking any email, text message, or news feed. I sit in a quiet corner of my room, focusing on breath awareness, bodily sensations, and practicing observing wandering thoughts without emotional judgment.\\n\\nEstablishing this habit was initially fraught with resistance. In the first three weeks, my restless mind screamed for digital stimulation. Sitting in silence felt unproductive and uncomfortable, and I frequently caught myself formulating mental to-do lists instead of maintaining mindful presence.\\n\\nHowever, by keeping the sessions short and consistent, neural pathways gradually adapted. The tangible benefits have been immense. My chronic reactivity to stress has plummeted, my attention span during analytical work has deepened significantly, and I no longer begin my mornings in an agitated state of fight-or-flight. It has become my indispensable cognitive anchor.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"mindfulness meditation\",\n      \"cognitive overload\",\n      \"breath awareness and presence\",\n      \"fraught with resistance\",\n      \"chronic reactivity to stress\",\n      \"indispensable cognitive anchor\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-24-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do so many people struggle to maintain New Year's fitness resolutions beyond January?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Address unrealistic drastic overhauls, relying on fleeting motivation rather than friction-reducing systems, and an all-or-nothing perfectionist mindset.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-24-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Should employers mandate wellness breaks and physical exercise during the working day?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Support voluntary incentivized wellness breaks (standing desks, gym subsidies, walking meetings) while respecting individual autonomy.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-24-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How do social media wellness influencers sometimes promote toxic or unrealistic health standards?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Critique filtered perfectionism, orthorexia (unhealthy obsession with pure eating), unscientific dietary supplements, and commercialized wellness guilt.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-25\",\n    \"topic\": \"An Occasion When Someone Was Extremely Polite to You\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an occasion when you experienced exceptional politeness or courtesy.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Where you were and who the courteous person was\",\n        \"What the situation was and how they demonstrated courtesy\",\n        \"Why their behavior stood out as remarkable\",\n        \"And explain how this courteous gesture made you feel\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An occasion of memorable courtesy took place two years ago at a central train terminal during the peak evening rush hour. I was traveling with two cumbersome heavy suitcases and an armful of presentation posters for an academic symposium.\\n\\nWhile hurrying toward the boarding platform, one of my suitcase handles snapped clean off, spilling reference folders across the busy concourse floor. In the frantic rush of hundreds of commuting passengers stepping around me, I felt utterly flustered and embarrassed.\\n\\nAt that moment, a smartly dressed gentleman in a business suit immediately stopped, dropped his briefcase, and knelt down to help me gather all the scattered papers. Seeing that I had only four minutes before departure, he unhesitatingly hoisted my heavy broken suitcase onto his shoulder and walked beside me through the crowd directly to my train carriage door, making sure I boarded safely before wishing me success at my conference.\\n\\nHis selfless gesture was remarkable because he was clearly commuting to an important commitment himself, yet he chose to expend energy assisting a flustered stranger without expecting any reward. In an individualistic society where hurried detachment is the norm, his instinctive chivalry restored my faith in everyday human decency. It inspired me to pay that generosity forward whenever I encounter someone struggling in public.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"memorable courtesy\",\n      \"cumbersome heavy suitcases\",\n      \"frantic rush\",\n      \"utterly flustered and embarrassed\",\n      \"selfless gesture\",\n      \"instinctive chivalry\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-25-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Are social standards of politeness declining in modern fast-paced societies?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Distinguish superficial formal etiquette (which may have relaxed) from authentic empathy and mutual respect, which remain strong in many communities.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-25-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"How do definitions of polite behavior differ between Western and Eastern cultural contexts?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Contrast direct, egalitarian eye contact and verbal assertiveness in the West with indirect deference, saving face, and subtle non-verbal politeness in the East.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-25-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"Why is customer service politeness in some industries perceived as artificial or insincere?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Explain corporate scripted emotional labor: employees are forced to smile mechanically under performance metrics, which customers perceive as transactional.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-26\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Creative Project or Craft You Completed\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a creative project, artwork, or craft you produced.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the project was and why you decided to create it\",\n        \"What materials, tools, or techniques you used\",\n        \"What creative challenges you encountered during the process\",\n        \"And explain how satisfied you were with the finished outcome\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A creative undertaking I thoroughly enjoyed was building a bespoke, hand-crafted wooden coffee table for my living room using reclaimed timber from an old barn demolition. I embarked on this project last summer because I wanted an authentic, rustic centerpiece with character rather than generic flat-pack commercial furniture.\\n\\nI procured salvaged oak planks, which possessed gorgeous natural wood grain and weathering. Over four weekends in a community maker-space workshop, I utilized hand planes, a circular saw, chisel sets, and an orbital sander to plane the uneven planks flat, join them with wooden dowels, and sand the surface progressively up to 400-grit smoothness before applying three protective coats of natural Danish oil.\\n\\nThe process demanded intense patience and physical accuracy. The most nerve-wracking challenge was ensuring the four joinery legs were perfectly plumb and level so the table would not wobble on hard floors. Cutting the mortise and tenon joints by hand required millimeter precision.\\n\\nWhen the final coat of oil cured and revealed the rich, glowing amber tones of the historic oak grain, I felt an immense surge of pride. Every minor indentation in the wood told a century-old story. Creating something durable with my own hands provided a tactile satisfaction that digital office work simply cannot match.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"bespoke hand-crafted wooden coffee table\",\n      \"salvaged oak planks\",\n      \"intense patience and physical accuracy\",\n      \"nerve-wracking challenge\",\n      \"tactile satisfaction\",\n      \"immense surge of pride\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-26-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why has there been a resurgence of interest in manual handicrafts (like woodworking and knitting) among digital professionals?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss the desire for tangible, screen-free tactile creation to counteract the abstract, ethereal nature of knowledge work in modern economies.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-26-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Can creativity be taught systematically in educational institutions, or is it purely innate?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Argue that while creative temperament varies, divergent thinking techniques, psychological safety, and diverse exposure can systematically cultivate creative capacity.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-26-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How will generative AI tools affect the economic livelihoods of human freelance artists and craftsmen?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Acknowledge disruption in commercial illustration/graphic design, while highlighting growing premium value placed on authentic physical human craftsmanship.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-27\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Live Sporting Event You Watched\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a live sports competition or match you attended.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the sport was and where the match took place\",\n        \"Who was competing and who you attended with\",\n        \"What the atmosphere in the stadium or arena was like\",\n        \"And explain why this particular sporting event was so exciting\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An exhilarating sporting spectacle I witnessed in person was a national football championship semi-final match between our city's club and their historic regional rivals, held at the sixty-thousand-seat National Stadium last October. I attended the game with my brother and two lifelong schoolmates.\\n\\nThe atmosphere inside the arena was absolutely deafening and electric. Both ends of the stadium were sea-like waves of team colors, with passionate supporter sections chanting synchronized anthems, waving massive banners, and beating bass drums from an hour before kickoff. You could physically feel the vibrational energy humming through the concrete stands.\\n\\nThe match itself was a nail-biting, dramatic rollercoaster. Our team fell behind by one goal early in the first half due to a defensive slip. However, in the eighty-seventh minute, our striker scored a sensational equalizing bicycle kick that sent the stadium into delirious pandemonium. In the dying seconds of stoppage time, a lightning counter-attack resulted in the winning goal.\\n\\nThe collective emotional catharsis when the final referee whistle blew was unforgettable. Complete strangers were hugging each other and singing in unison. It highlighted the unique power of sport to dissolve social barriers and unite an entire city in shared euphoria.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"exhilarating sporting spectacle\",\n      \"deafening and electric\",\n      \"nail-biting dramatic rollercoaster\",\n      \"delirious pandemonium\",\n      \"collective emotional catharsis\",\n      \"dissolve social barriers\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-27-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do mega sports tournaments like the Olympic Games and World Cup ignite such fervent national pride?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Analyze symbolic representation of national prowess, shared communal ritual, global visibility, and historical athletic prestige.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-27-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Are professional elite athletes paid excessively high salaries compared to vital public workers like nurses and teachers?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Debate market economics (massive global broadcast rights and brief career spans) versus ethical societal valuation of essential civic professions.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-27-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"What measures should sports governing bodies take to combat hooliganism and toxic sportsmanship?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Recommend strict stadium bans for offenders, alcohol restrictions at high-risk derbies, player behavioral codes, and promoting grassroots fair play.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-28\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Time You Made a Consumer Complaint\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a time you complained about a faulty service or defective product.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"What the product or service was and what went wrong\",\n        \"Where and how you lodged your complaint\",\n        \"How the company or staff handled your concern\",\n        \"And explain how satisfied you were with the resolution\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"An occasion when I had to lodge a formal consumer complaint occurred six months ago with a prominent domestic airline after they misplaced my checked luggage on a connecting flight to an academic conference.\\n\\nUpon landing at my destination, my luggage failed to appear on the carousel. Inside that suitcase were my professional formal suit, conference badges, and essential medical supplies. The baggage inquiry desk agent was initially dismissive, handing me a generic automated claims pamphlet and refusing to track the bag's electronic tag status.\\n\\nFrustrated by the lack of empathy, I remained composed but assertive. I requested to speak with the airport duty station manager, presented my boarding passes and baggage claim receipts, and clearly articulated the consequential damages I faced if my belongings were not located before morning. I documented the interaction, noted employee names, and filed a formal digital grievance via their executive complaints portal.\\n\\nRecognizing the severity of the oversight, the manager took personal ownership of the situation. Within four hours, they located the bag at the transit hub, arranged for an express courier to deliver it directly to my hotel room by midnight, and issued a complimentary travel voucher as compensation. While the initial error was frustrating, the prompt and dignified resolution restored my confidence in their accountability.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"formal consumer complaint\",\n      \"composed but assertive\",\n      \"consequential damages\",\n      \"formal digital grievance\",\n      \"took personal ownership\",\n      \"prompt and dignified resolution\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-28-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why do many dissatisfied customers choose to rant on public social media rather than filing private complaints?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Explain algorithmic public shaming: public posts threaten brand reputation, compelling companies to respond faster than bureaucratic email queues.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-28-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"How can corporations turn customer complaints into opportunities for long-term customer loyalty?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Cite the service recovery paradox: resolving an error swiftly with generous empathy often leaves customers more loyal than if no error had occurred.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-28-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"What consumer protection laws are most essential in regulating e-commerce returns and refunds?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Highlight mandatory 14-day cooling-off return windows, clear merchant liability for counterfeit goods, and secure escrow payment protections.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-29\",\n    \"topic\": \"A Quiet Place You Go to Concentrate or Relax\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe a tranquil and quiet place you enjoy visiting.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Where the place is and how you discovered it\",\n        \"What the environment and surroundings look like\",\n        \"What you typically do while you are there\",\n        \"And explain why this place is so conducive to peace of mind\"\n      ],\n      \"prepTimeSeconds\": 60,\n      \"speakTimeSeconds\": 120\n    },\n    \"sampleAnswer\": \"A peaceful sanctuary that I cherish is the upper rooftop conservatory garden of our city's central public library. I stumbled upon this hidden gem during my second year at university while searching for a quiet location away from crowded campus study halls.\\n\\nThe space is enclosed by floor-to-ceiling glass panels overlooking the historic city skyline. Inside, it is filled with lush subtropical palms, creeping ivy, and delicate orchids, accompanied by a small stone fountain where water trickles softly over river pebbles. There are comfortable ergonomic reading chairs tucked between the foliage, and strict quiet policies ensure there is zero audible chatter or ringtones.\\n\\nWhenever I feel overwhelmed by deadlines or cognitive fatigue, I retreat to this space with a notebook and a novel. I spend two or three hours reading, brainstorming academic ideas, or simply watching the clouds drift across the urban horizon in contemplative silence.\\n\\nThis sanctuary is invaluable because it offers psychological decompression right in the heart of a bustling metropolis. The combination of abundant natural daylight, oxygenating greenery, and acoustic stillness lowers my pulse and restores mental clarity. It is my favorite refuge from modern urban chaos.\",\n    \"keyCollocations\": [\n      \"peaceful sanctuary\",\n      \"hidden gem\",\n      \"lush subtropical foliage\",\n      \"contemplative silence\",\n      \"psychological decompression\",\n      \"refuge from modern urban chaos\"\n    ],\n    \"part3Questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-29-q1\",\n        \"question\": \"Why is ambient noise pollution in modern cities recognized as an urgent public health hazard?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Discuss chronic elevation of stress hormones (cortisol, adrenaline), sleep fragmentation, cardiovascular hypertension, and impaired cognitive development in children.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-29-q2\",\n        \"question\": \"Should urban municipal planners mandate designated 'quiet zones' in public parks and residential zones?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Strongly support quiet zones, citing the restorative necessity of acoustic refuges for mental health in high-density metropolitan areas.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"p3-29-q3\",\n        \"question\": \"How do open-plan offices affect workplace productivity compared to quiet private cubicles?\",\n        \"sampleOutline\": \"Highlight how constant conversational interruptions and visual distractions in open-plan offices severely erode deep focused analytical productivity.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-30\",\n    \"topic\": \"Valuable Advice You Received from Someone You Respect\",\n    \"cueCard\": {\n      \"topic\": \"Describe an important piece of advice you received that proved valuable.\",\n      \"bulletPoints\": [\n        \"Who gave you the advice and what circumstance prompted it\",\n       